n	k_values	p_values
61	56	57

query
SELECT a, k, l, p FROM df_s WHERE a IN (0, 1, 13, 42, 59999) ORDER BY a;
----
a	k	l	p
0	NULL	NULL	NULL
1	k-1	l-1	row 1 of the plain column
13	(empty)	l-13	row 13 of the plain column
42	k-42	NULL	row 42 of the plain column
59999	k-2999	l-499	row 59999 of the plain column

